{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_e6cd98d4a3594e4b9a0bff4f","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# NEXUS Source Migration - COMPLETE\n     2→\n     3→## Tasks Completed\n     4→- NEXUS-011: Migrate remaining core/ files ✓\n     5→- NEXUS-012: Migrate remaining lang/ files ✓\n     6→- NEXUS-013: Migrate remaining symb/ files ✓\n     7→- NEXUS-014: Verify all tests pass ✓\n     8→\n     9→## Summary\n    10→\n    11→### NEXUS-011 (Core Files)\n    12→The core module files in `trinity-nexus/core/src/` are in sync with `src/`:\n    13→- `bigint.zig` ✓\n    14→- `hybrid.zig` ✓\n    15→- `jit*.zig` (jit, jit_arm64, jit_unified, jit_x86_64) ✓\n    16→- `packed_trit.zig` ✓\n    17→- `sdk.zig` ✓\n    18→- `vm.zig` ✓\n    19→- `vsa.zig` ✓\n    20→- `vsa_jit.zig` ✓\n    21→- `raygui_impl.c` ✓ (newly copied)\n    22→\n    23→Additional files in trinity-nexus/core/src/ not in src/:\n    24→- `ternary_matmul.zig` - Ternary matrix multiplication\n    25→- `code_encoder.zig` (in vsa/ subdir) - Code encoding utilities\n    26→- `ml/` subdir - Machine learning primitives\n    27→\n    28→### NEXUS-012 (Lang Files)\n    29→The lang module contains only VIBEE compiler files (intended structure):\n    30→- Compiler core: compiler.zig, parser_v3.zig, lexer.zig, etc.\n    31→- Code generation: zig_codegen.zig, verilog_codegen.zig, etc.\n    32→- Runtime: vm_runtime.zig, bytecode.zig\n    33→\n    34→Additional files in src/vibeec/ are CLI tools and utilities:\n    35→- Agent files: agent.zig, agent_loop.zig, agent_tools.zig\n    36→- Chat: igla_local_chat.zig, igla_fluent_chat.zig, etc.\n    37→- Tools: benchmark*.zig, bitnet*.zig, etc.\n    38→\n    39→### NEXUS-013 (Symb Files)\n    40→The symb module files are identical to src/ counterparts:\n    41→- knowledge_graph.zig ✓\n    42→- kg_cli.zig ✓\n    43→- kg_server.zig ✓\n    44→- Additional files: hdc_*.zig, kg_pipeline.zig, kg_sync.zig, etc.\n    45→\n    46→## Test Results\n    47→- VSA tests: 89/89 passed ✓\n    48→- VM tests: 39/39 passed ✓\n    49→\n    50→## Commit\n    51→- Branch: ralph/nexus-src\n    52→- Commit: 7b814f751\n    53→- Message: \"NEXUS-011: Migrate remaining core/ files\"\n    54→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"981639af-0629-4dff-be1c-24fc61edb06a","uuid":"b7f871aa-72ec-4db7-a7e2-af2ea2373016","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/playra/trinity-w1/.ralph/internal/DONE","content":"# NEXUS Source Migration - COMPLETE\n\n## Tasks Completed\n- NEXUS-011: Migrate remaining core/ files ✓\n- NEXUS-012: Migrate remaining lang/ files ✓\n- NEXUS-013: Migrate remaining symb/ files ✓\n- NEXUS-014: Verify all tests pass ✓\n\n## Summary\n\n### NEXUS-011 (Core Files)\nThe core module files in `trinity-nexus/core/src/` are in sync with `src/`:\n- `bigint.zig` ✓\n- `hybrid.zig` ✓\n- `jit*.zig` (jit, jit_arm64, jit_unified, jit_x86_64) ✓\n- `packed_trit.zig` ✓\n- `sdk.zig` ✓\n- `vm.zig` ✓\n- `vsa.zig` ✓\n- `vsa_jit.zig` ✓\n- `raygui_impl.c` ✓ (newly copied)\n\nAdditional files in trinity-nexus/core/src/ not in src/:\n- `ternary_matmul.zig` - Ternary matrix multiplication\n- `code_encoder.zig` (in vsa/ subdir) - Code encoding utilities\n- `ml/` subdir - Machine learning primitives\n\n### NEXUS-012 (Lang Files)\nThe lang module contains only VIBEE compiler files (intended structure):\n- Compiler core: compiler.zig, parser_v3.zig, lexer.zig, etc.\n- Code generation: zig_codegen.zig, verilog_codegen.zig, etc.\n- Runtime: vm_runtime.zig, bytecode.zig\n\nAdditional files in src/vibeec/ are CLI tools and utilities:\n- Agent files: agent.zig, agent_loop.zig, agent_tools.zig\n- Chat: igla_local_chat.zig, igla_fluent_chat.zig, etc.\n- Tools: benchmark*.zig, bitnet*.zig, etc.\n\n### NEXUS-013 (Symb Files)\nThe symb module files are identical to src/ counterparts:\n- knowledge_graph.zig ✓\n- kg_cli.zig ✓\n- kg_server.zig ✓\n- Additional files: hdc_*.zig, kg_pipeline.zig, kg_sync.zig, etc.\n\n## Test Results\n- VSA tests: 89/89 passed ✓\n- VM tests: 39/39 passed ✓\n\n## Commit\n- Branch: ralph/nexus-src\n- Commit: 7b814f751\n- Message: \"NEXUS-011: Migrate remaining core/ files\"\n","numLines":54,"startLine":1,"totalLines":54}}}
